    activationBorderColor: "#4a5568"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Node as ContextHelp Node
    participant Registry as Paid Registry
    participant AuthService as Auth Service
    participant EntitlementSvc as Entitlement Service

    Note over User,EntitlementSvc: Just-In-Time (JIT) Content Resolution Flow<br/>(For Paid/Licensed Registries)

    User->>Node: ctxt search "advanced patterns"

    Node->>Registry: GET /bookmarks?q=advanced+patterns
    activate Registry
    Note right of Registry: Registry allows index sync<br/>but not full content replication<br/>("localCopy": "index")
    Registry-->>Node: 200 OK<br/>Index-level results:<br/>{<br/>  "items": [<br/>    {<br/>      "id": "adv-001",<br/>      "title": "...",<br/>      "summary": "...",<br/>      "tags": [...],<br/>      "fullContentAvailable": true<br/>    }<br/>  ]<br/>}
    deactivate Registry

    Node-->>User: Display search results<br/>(headers + summaries)

    User->>Node: ctxt show adv-001<br/>(request full content)

    Node->>Node: Check local cache

    alt Content not cached
        Node->>AuthService: Validate user credentials
        AuthService-->>Node: Valid session token

        Node->>EntitlementSvc: Check user entitlements<br/>for registry content
        EntitlementSvc-->>Node: Entitlement: GRANTED<br/>(credits available)

        Node->>Registry: GET /bookmarks/adv-001
        activate Registry
        Note right of Registry: Requires authentication<br/>May be metered/credited
        Registry-->>Node: 200 OK<br/>Full content with metadata
        deactivate Registry

        Node->>EntitlementSvc: Report usage<br/>(decrement credits)

        Node->>Node: Cache full content locally<br/>(with TTL/expiry)
    end

    Node-->>User: Display full content

    Note over User,EntitlementSvc: This enables paid registries to:<br/>- Improve retrieval (index available)<br/>- Protect content (no bulk sync)<br/>- Meter usage (credits per access)
```
